    alias: "carlospan"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/carlospan/qi-perch"
url: "https://github.com/carlospan/qi-perch"
abstract: >-
  Qi (栖) is an open-source local digital being: continuous heartbeat, memory with
  forgetting, emotion dynamics, relationship, and a desktop window. Design treats
  the LLM as a language organ (N5) behind intention cards, not as the source of
  shared memory. Architecture defines inspectable digital-life criteria C1–C5 and
  explicitly does not claim consciousness or qualia. Canonical documentation is
  Chinese; English abstracts support international research readers.
keywords:
  - digital being
  - endogenous cognition
  - artificial life
  - companion AI
  - intention card
  - language organ
  - local AI
